+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Added
+
+- Added Progress.TimeElapsedColumn to display time elapsed, frozen once a task is finished
+- Added `Palette.__rich__` to render a palette as a table
+
+### Changed
+
+- Task.finished is now true when a finished time has been captured, rather than when completed is at least total
+
